# 01 - Top client IPs
# Purpose: See which client IPs generate the most web traffic.
# Sourcetype: access_combined* (access_combined_wcookie in the tutorial data)
# Look for: One IP far above the rest, or an unfamiliar IP dominating requests.
# Time range: All time (the tutorial dataset is old, so recent ranges return nothing)
# Index: tutorial

index=tutorial sourcetype=access_combined* | top limit=10 clientip
